## Scope

Docs-only reconsolidation on `devcontainer`:
- preserve user-originated raw thoughts separately from AI inference and verified evidence;
- record that PR #4 merged in GitHub but did not receive the user's approval;
- keep E/F/G review distinct from PR #4 / presentation approval;
- retract the earlier ~116.6 s pellet-diffusion claim while preserving the history entry, and label the user-specified ~0.001166 s correction as requiring independent input/unit verification;
- add a focused parked Wayfinder for numerical attenuation, pellet radius/diffusion, size distributions, transport/kinetics mapping, conservation, experimental benchmarking and the 2022 memory mechanism.

The scientific recommendation in the capture is explicitly marked as AI inference, not a user decision. The map does not dispatch implementation or raise priority.

## Evidence boundary

The comparison distinguishes source-to-code consistency from reproduction against measured data. No code was changed and no simulation or test was run.

## Review note

This PR records and organizes the user's feedback. It does not approve the existing presentation draft or PR #4's content.
